// Setup: Pure standard library facade module importing all telecom_6g domain modules and providing unified system configurations.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import 49 modular sub-THz physics, RIS metasurfaces, Holographic MIMO, ISAC radar, OAM, and 6G PHY submodules.
//   2. Define top-level 6G Terahertz and ISAC dual-function transceiver system configuration structures.
//   3. Provide unified factory constructors and API shims for seamless openOODA 6G telecom integration.

